444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Industries have made us believe that we need lots of different and specific cleaning products, all coming from big idnustries and plastic packaging. In reality, the only thing we truly need to clean our homes and even ourselves is water.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
